Sessions anchored to local clocks:
- Tokyo 09:00 JST, which is 20:00 EDT but 19:00 EST;
- Shanghai 09:00, which is 20:00 EST / 21:00 EDT;
- Frankfurt 08:00 CET, which is 02:00 ET except 03:00 in the US/EU mismatch weeks (2nd Sunday of March to last Sunday of March; last Sunday of October to 1st Sunday of November);
- London 08:00, which is 03:00 ET except 04:00 in the mismatch weeks.

proposals.spec:
Input mktIn = Auto | Index Futures | Other Futures | FX/Spot Metals | Crypto | US Stocks | Other (G_CONF).

Auto classification (global, simple strings):
- crypto: syminfo.type == "crypto", or futures with basecurrency BTC/ETH;
- futures: index futures when the root is in "|ES|MES|NQ|MNQ|YM|MYM|RTY|M2K|" via str.contains(source, str), else other futures;
- FX: syminfo.type == "forex" or basecurrency XAU/XAG;
- stocks: stock, fund or dr;
- otherwise other.
Also hasVol = syminfo.volumetype != "n/a" and is247 = (mkt == crypto).

Preset table:
- day boundary;
- key-level session (ASSET-3);
- session set: stocks drop Asia/London, and midOpen falls back to the 09:30 RTH open or the 04:00 pre-market open; crypto sessions run weekdays only;
- killzone days: crypto excludes Sat/Sun UTC via dayofweek(time, "UTC"); stocks kzNA 0930-1100 and kzNP 1500-1600;
- guards (ASSET-4/5);
- event preset (ASSET-8).

Terminal panel line 'MKT IDX FUT · DAY 18:00 ET · RTH 09:30-16:15 · CLOCK LOCAL'. Clean style: tooltip line only.

Where: new inputs after line 226; detection in SERIES before 945; gating at 947 (intraOK), 964-966 and 971-976.

State:
- isCont = futures and not na(syminfo.current_contract);
- cOff = request.security(ticker.modify(syminfo.tickerid, backadjustment = backadjustment.off), timeframe.period, close), and cOn likewise with backadjustment.on (same-timeframe requests, 2 extra);
- adjD = cOff - cOn;
- chartAdj = |close - cOn| < |close - cOff|;
- rollJump = isCont and not chartAdj ? adjD - adjD[1] : 0;
- rollBar = |rollJump| > mintick.

On rollBar (confirmed), shift by rollJump:
- pool levels (price/top/bottom/oTop/oBot);
- extReg px;
- iFVG trackers;
- aPDH/aPDL/aPWH/aPWL, the open anchors and obSwingH/L;
- open trials (edge/inv/entry).

On that bar, skip sweeps, raids and FVG/OB creation; block FVGs whose 3-bar window straddles the roll; optionally draw a 'ROLL +x' marker. Where the option is unavailable, cOff == cOn and the handler is a no-op.

For mkt == crypto: dowU = dayofweek(time, "UTC"); wkend = Saturday or Sunday.

Track wkH/wkL and their bars from wkStart to wkEnd (first Monday 00:00 UTC bar). On wkEnd, push src 9 'WKND H/L' (tier 0.70) with hlm = sqrt(bars per day).

