nextEv = the soonest event within time + H*chartS*1000.

Uses:
1. HUD '⚑ FOMC 14:00 in 2h10', Clean tooltip line, optional alert.
2. Variance: with TIME-1, scale clock cells in [ev, ev+30m) by evX (FOMC 2.5, metals 4.0, certain 08:30 1.3, possible 1.1, EIA 1.2). Without TIME-1, scale potSig by sqrt(1 + (evX-1)*evBars/H).
3. Raids in [ev, ev+15m) add 0.5x to liqEvt (1582).
4. Trials opened in [ev-30m, ev+15m) set t.news; the Full accuracy view splits HIT%/EDGE into news and non-news (f_book 1461).
